43
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:48,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi...</font>

44
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the very least this sword...</font>

45
00:01:56,990 --> 00:01:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a fitting end for somebody like you</font>

46
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:02,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who has mastered
the Shinobi Way.</font>

47
00:02:09,110 --> 00:02:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It feels like my arms are burning...</font>

48
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama!</font>

49
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:16,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is where we call off our plan.</font>

50
00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:20,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release the Barrier.
We'll head back.</font>

51
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:21,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes!
— Yes!</font>

52
00:02:21,670 --> 00:02:22,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Release!
— Release!</font>

53
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Barrier...!</font>

54
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:28,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's released!</font>

55
00:02:29,550 --> 00:02:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is Hokage-sama?</font>

56
00:02:36,890 --> 00:02:37,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

57
00:02:39,780 --> 00:02:40,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't let you get away!</font>

58
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:47,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Spider Web Net!</font>

59
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:52,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An adhesive type of string
filled with Chakra...?</font>

60
00:02:54,990 --> 00:02:57,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi! They're on the move!
Do we go after them?</font>

61
00:02:57,340 --> 00:02:59,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, wait, Guy.</font>

62
00:02:59,690 --> 00:03:00,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

63
00:03:01,470 --> 00:03:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you make a move without
any data on the situation up there,</font>

64
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you will get caught in
the enemy's trap.</font>

65
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:09,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm totally aware of that.</font>

66
00:03:09,940 --> 00:03:11,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But regardless of whether
there is a trap or not,</font>

67
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we can't let the enemy get away
at a time like this!</font>

68
00:03:14,090 --> 00:03:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is the way of the Leaf Shinobi!</font>

69
00:03:16,550 --> 00:03:19,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... are you just going to watch?</font>

70
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto?</font>

71
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:27,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you did know, after all.</font>

72
00:03:27,330 --> 00:03:28,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... what are we going to do?</font>

73
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time that
we made a retreat.</font>

74
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to run away
from me again?</font>

75
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:35,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now...</font>

76
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:39,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we show our cards,
they're most likely going to be copied.</font>

77
00:03:40,970 --> 00:03:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then again,</font>

78
00:03:42,070 --> 00:03:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it doesn't seem like you've completely
mastered that eye like the Uchiha clan.</font>

79
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then...</font>

80
00:04:07,990 --> 00:04:08,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari...</font>

81
00:04:15,350 --> 00:04:16,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kankuro!</font>

82
00:04:42,820 --> 00:04:43,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm leaving Sakura with you.</font>

83
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey!</font>

84
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:06,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is... this guy so strong?</font>

85
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My existence will not disappear...</font>

86
00:05:11,090 --> 00:05:14,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not disappear!
I cannot disappear!</font>

87
00:05:37,090 --> 00:05:39,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you not to talk to that guy!</font>

88
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

89
00:05:45,620 --> 00:05:48,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, there! That's him...</font>

90
00:05:50,670 --> 00:05:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go away!</font>

91
00:05:54,700 --> 00:06:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Monster! Monster! Monster...!</font>

92
00:06:09,990 --> 00:06:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You monster! Die!</font>

93
00:06:14,830 --> 00:06:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's him... Don't get involved, fool!</font>

94
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:22,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't look at him!</font>

95
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go away!</font>

96
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To them, I'm just a relic of the past
who they want to see disappear.</font>

97
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:59,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what did I have in this life,
why did I keep living?</font>

98
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that time, I thought of myself that I...
no, that is what I had to think.</font>

99
00:07:08,710 --> 00:07:12,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then knew that
it was the most painful thing.</font>

100
00:07:13,990 --> 00:07:19,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That I... that my existence didn't matter
to anyone else in the world.</font>

101
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Don't come any closer!</font>

102
00:07:30,930 --> 00:07:37,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The pain of... being all alone...
really is unbearable, isn't it?</font>

103
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The way you feel...</font>

104
00:07:42,950 --> 00:07:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know why,
but I completely understand that it hurts.</font>

105
00:07:47,570 --> 00:07:52,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I've met people who are
very important to me now.</font>

106
00:07:55,750 --> 00:08:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't allow those important people...
to get hurt!</font>

107
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:08,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If not, I will stop you even if
that means... that I have to kill you!</font>

108
00:08:09,330 --> 00:08:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

109
00:08:11,390 --> 00:08:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is it that you can fight so much
for other people?</font>

110
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They saved me from the hell
of being all alone.</font>

111
00:08:20,050 --> 00:08:22,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They accepted me for who I was.</font>

112
00:08:23,820 --> 00:08:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why... they are important to me!</font>

113
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:38,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love is a heart that desires to serve
a precious person who is close to oneself,</font>

114
00:08:38,990 --> 00:08:41,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to love and watch over that person...</font>

115
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love...</font>

116
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is why he is so strong?</font>

117
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough, Naruto...</font>

118
00:08:57,630 --> 00:08:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura is okay.</font>

119
00:09:00,650 --> 00:09:02,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's Chakra must
have been depleted as well...</font>

120
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:05,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura's sand crumbled
a long time ago.</font>

121
00:09:06,570 --> 00:09:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see...</font>

122
00:09:15,450 --> 00:09:18,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had enough... Stop here.</font>

123
00:09:18,990 --> 00:09:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara?</font>

124
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen Gaara in such
a weakened state before...</font>

125
00:09:30,390 --> 00:09:31,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

126
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto, huh?</font>

127
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:11,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One of these days, even I...</font>

128
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:12,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"LOVE"</b></font>

129
00:10:15,810 --> 00:10:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari... Kankuro...</font>

130
00:10:18,050 --> 00:10:18,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?</font>

131
00:10:19,930 --> 00:10:20,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry...</font>

132
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Don't worry about it...</font>

133
00:12:23,510 --> 00:12:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rain...</font>

134
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sky has started to weep as well...</font>

135
00:12:29,930 --> 00:12:31,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will begin the memorial service</font>

136
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the Third Hokage,
who lost his life in this battle,</font>

137
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:38,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as well as the other victims
of this battle.</font>

138
00:12:40,780 --> 00:12:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's started...</font>

139
00:12:42,780 --> 00:12:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the end,
all we could do was just watch...</font>

140
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:07,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

141
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:11,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did Old Man Hokage have to die?</font>

142
00:13:21,190 --> 00:13:22,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

143
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already been a year...</font>

144
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not easy to laugh
hiding your sadness.</font>

145
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard from your teacher that
you're the center of laughter...</font>

146
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not sad at all!</font>

147
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:59,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a very honorable thing for
a Shinobi to die doing their duty!</font>

148
00:13:59,730 --> 00:14:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My dad and mom sacrificed their lives</font>

149
00:14:01,610 --> 00:14:04,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to protect this village
from the Demon Fox...</font>

150
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:06,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're heroes!</font>

151
00:14:06,530 --> 00:14:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the child of the heroes!
I'm not sad to be alone.</font>

152
00:14:13,490 --> 00:14:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And besides, these are tears of joy.</font>

153
00:14:15,830 --> 00:14:17,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right.</font>

154
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that you're curled up
holding your knees by yourself.</font>

155
00:14:26,670 --> 00:14:29,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you're not alone...</font>

156
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:30,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

157
00:14:31,850 --> 00:14:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shinobi of the Hidden Leaf Village
have the will of fire...</font>

158
00:14:37,310 --> 00:14:38,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Will of fire...?</font>

159
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:42,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the strong will to protect
the Leaf Village.</font>

160
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as they have this will of fire,
everybody in this village are all family.</font>

161
00:14:50,410 --> 00:14:54,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka... I wonder if you have it?</font>

162
00:14:58,790 --> 00:14:59,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

163
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For Hayate...?</font>

164
00:15:29,070 --> 00:15:32,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hokage's funeral
has already started. Make it quick.</font>

165
00:15:33,780 --> 00:15:36,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You too, Kakashi-Senpai, is it for Obito-san...?</font>

166
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're always thinking of
an excuse for your tardiness,</font>

167
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:44,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you should just come earlier.</font>

168
00:15:48,380 --> 00:15:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I do... from early in the morning.</font>

169
00:15:53,590 --> 00:15:55,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just that,
whenever I come here</font>

170
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:59,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just want to punish myself
for being such a fool in the past.</font>

171
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:07,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph...</font>

172
00:16:33,970 --> 00:16:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi, no matter what kind
of situation they are in,</font>

173
00:16:37,470 --> 00:16:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">cannot show their emotion.</font>

174
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must always prioritize your mission,</font>

175
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:46,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and never shed a tear in
any kind of situation...</font>

176
00:17:46,710 --> 00:17:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei...</font>

177
00:17:48,210 --> 00:17:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

178
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do people risk their own lives
for other people?</font>

179
00:17:58,390 --> 00:18:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When one person dies...</font>

180
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">their past, their present life,
and their future disappear along with them.</font>

181
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Many people die doing their duty
and fighting in battle...</font>

182
00:18:12,360 --> 00:18:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And shockingly easily, too.</font>

183
00:18:17,570 --> 00:18:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hayate was one of them.</font>

184
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who pass away also
have dreams and ambitions.</font>

185
00:18:25,370 --> 00:18:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But everyone has something else,
just as important.</font>

186
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:37,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Parents, siblings, friends, lovers...
Those who are dear to them.</font>

187
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They trust each other and help each other,</font>

188
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:46,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the people whom they've cherished
since the day they were born.</font>

189
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:50,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that string which connects
those people</font>

190
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:53,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">becomes stronger and
thicker as time goes by...</font>

191
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:57,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be explained by logic...</font>

192
00:18:57,780 --> 00:19:03,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who hold those strings just do it,
because it's important to them.</font>

193
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I kind of get it.</font>

194
00:19:09,710 --> 00:19:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

195
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's tough to die.</font>

196
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:19,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like he just died for nothing.</font>

197
00:19:20,010 --> 00:19:22,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He left us something very important.</font>

198
00:19:24,050 --> 00:19:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you'll eventually understand
one of these days.</font>

199
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I kind of get that too!</font>

200
00:19:35,650 --> 00:19:37,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rain's stopped.</font>

201
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bye! Iruka-sensei!</font>

202
00:19:49,790 --> 00:19:50,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

203
00:19:52,830 --> 00:19:56,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third Hokage-sama,
the will of fire you spoke of</font>

204
00:19:57,340 --> 00:20:02,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seems to have been passed on
to the young Leaves.</font>

205
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:07,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The flame in their hearts
which you lit</font>

206
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:10,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will burn bright and strong...</font>

207
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:15,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it will shine upon this village,
and watch over and protect us.</font>

208
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will become a new Hokage...
one of these days...</font>

209
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:36,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They did manage to avoid annihilation,</font>

210
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:38,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it seems the damage
is pretty extensive.</font>

211
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The village that was once
at the height of its glory...</font>

212
00:20:43,010 --> 00:20:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How sad...</font>

213
00:20:47,010 --> 00:20:48,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How unlike you.</font>

214
00:20:49,140 --> 00:20:52,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have lingering affections
for your old home?</font>

215
00:20:52,850 --> 00:20:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even you?</font>

216
00:20:54,810 --> 00:20:57,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, not at all.</font>

217
00:21:09,590 --> 00:21:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

218
00:21:09,590 --> 00:21:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

219
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

220
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

221
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

222
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

223
00:21:27,650 --> 00:21:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">wakiyaku dakedo</font></font></b></font>

224
00:21:27,650 --> 00:21:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">it's a secondary role</font></font></b></font>

225
00:21:33,460 --> 00:21:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kage no hito dakedo</font></font></b></font>

226
00:21:33,460 --> 00:21:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a role in the shadows</font></font></b></font>

227
00:21:36,860 --> 00:21:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume to mukiau toki kurai</font></font></b></font>

228
00:21:36,860 --> 00:21:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but in reaching for that dream</font></font></b></font>

229
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">man naka ni isasete shoujiki ni isasete</font></font></b></font>

230
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">let us stay centered, let us stay true</font></font></b></font>

231
00:21:47,840 --> 00:21:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo nan toka akiramezu ni</font></font></b></font>

232
00:21:47,840 --> 00:21:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we hung on without giving up</font></font></b></font>

233
00:21:52,610 --> 00:21:57,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo tachi agatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

234
00:21:52,610 --> 00:21:57,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we kept coming back up</font></font></b></font>

235
00:21:57,310 --> 00:21:59,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo</font></font></b></font>

236
00:21:57,310 --> 00:22:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we believed and dreamed</font></font></b></font>

237
00:21:59,620 --> 00:22:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">bokura</font></font></b></font>

238
00:22:00,550 --> 00:22:02,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

239
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">shinjite</font></font></b></font>

240
00:22:03,150 --> 00:22:04,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">nandomo</font></font></b></font>

241
00:22:04,490 --> 00:22:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">yume mite nandomo</font></font></b></font>

242
00:22:07,430 --> 00:22:12,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo baka o mite kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

243
00:22:07,430 --> 00:22:12,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've seen fools</font></font></b></font>

244
00:22:12,630 --> 00:22:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">ima made nandomo hito no kage ni tatte kita janai ka</font></font></b></font>

245
00:22:12,630 --> 00:22:17,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">over and over, we've stood in the shadows of others</font></font></b></font>

246
00:22:19,670 --> 00:22:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">saa shuyaku da yo jibun no yume kurai wagamama de isasete</font></font></b></font>

247
00:22:19,670 --> 00:22:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">now, it's our turn... let us bask in our dreams</font></font></b></font>

248
00:22:35,790 --> 00:22:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">The ritual ends, and morning mist
will be covering all soon.</font>

249
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:42,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Silence...</font>

250
00:22:42,710 --> 00:22:46,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">In that white mist,
the shadow quietly sharpens its fangs.</font>

251
00:22:48,050 --> 00:22:54,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It awakens childhood memory,
disappointment, ire, and resolve.</font>

252
00:22:56,060 --> 00:23:00,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">The cog wheel named destiny
slowly begins to turn...</font>

253
00:23:02,270 --> 00:23:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Return of the Morning Mist."</font>

